  - llm
  - google-gemini
abstract: >-
  Three Python scripts that turn the LaTeX lists of an academic CV into JSON files for a website:
  journal papers and book chapters, completed with their DOI, abstract, publisher page, preprints
  and keywords from CrossRef, Google Scholar, Semantic Scholar, Unpaywall, arXiv, HAL and the
  publishers' pages, and collaborators, completed with their affiliation, a geocoded city and
  public profiles checked by strict rules. Language models (Claude and Gemini) parse the entries
  and extract what the web pages hold, and every answer is cached.
